      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。我已经和执行委员长商量过了——\n希望在当天，能用比往年更多的鲜花来装饰直道舞会的会场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a818d5ab506374c737b6cfa4c0c909f522b955f3a8656014144f846091791ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
